# kin/youth/wear/tunic_hang: the tunic's skirt: two rows to the lit hem over the trousers; it widens on the side walk's
# contact and down frames (wide) and flares in the run; kneel (the fall's buckle) spreads it; lie (lying) drapes it
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. The girl's skirt starts from her narrower waist.
# Motion fix round 3 (R3-06): the side (R, L) wide and flare keys (the side walk and run) end a row higher than rest, so
# the youth's thighs show under the hem (the tunic a lone hem row); the hang moves with the body on the down frames.
use person
body youth
role garment tunic
layer hangBack
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 1

view D key rest origin 6 0
|.6886776765.
|.5986857765.

view D key rest origin 6 0 when girl replace
|..68877665..
|.5986857765.

view D key wide origin 6 0
|.6886776765.
|.5986857765.

view D key wide origin 6 0 when girl replace
|..68877665..
|.5986857765.

view D key flare origin 6 0
|.6886776765.
|598685877665

